        <headline>Lake Wind Advisory issued September 25 at 10:00AM PDT until September 25 at 8:00PM PDT by NWS Reno NV</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Southwest winds 10 to 20 mph with gusts up to 35 mph. Waves
1 to 3 feet on Lake Tahoe.

* WHERE...Greater Lake Tahoe Area, and Lassen-Eastern Plumas-Eastern
Sierra Counties.

* WHEN...Until 8 PM PDT this evening.

* IMPACTS...Strong winds and rough waves on area lakes will create
hazardous conditions for small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Check lake conditions before heading out and be prepared for a sudden
increase in winds and wave heights. Consider postponing boating
activities on the lake until a day with less wind.</instruction>
